{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a7b3c9d2-ecom-uploads-api-2026",
    "name": "Ecommerce Backend — File/Image Uploads API",
    "description": "Multer + Cloudinary upload endpoints ka testing collection.\n\nFlow:\n1. Pehle 'Register Admin' ya 'Login Admin' chalao (token automatically capture ho jaata hai)\n2. Upload endpoints test karo — file select karna mat bhoolna form-data me!\n3. Upload response me `publicId` milta hai — wo {{publicId}} variable me save ho jaata hai (Delete test ke liye)\n4. Product create/update bhi ab multipart/form-data support karta hai (\"images\" field)\n\n⚠️ Note: .env me CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME, CLOUDINARY_API_KEY, CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET set hona chahiye, warna 503 error aayega.\n\nLimits:\n- Images: sirf jpeg/jpg/png/webp/gif/avif, max 5MB each\n- Product images: max 5 files per request (field name: \"images\")\n- Files (pdf/doc/zip/txt/csv/json): max 10MB (field name: \"file\")",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:5000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "admin@test.com", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "admin123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "productId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "publicId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health Check",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", json.data.token);",
                  "    console.log(\"Admin token captured ✅\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Test Admin\",\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\",\n  \"role\": \"admin\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", json.data.token);",
                  "    console.log(\"Admin token captured ✅\");",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Uploads",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upload Single Image (field: image)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.publicId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"publicId\", json.data.publicId);",
                  "    console.log(\"publicId captured ✅\");",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test(\"Upload successful\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "image",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Select an image file (jpeg/png/webp/gif/avif, max 5MB)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/uploads/image",
            "description": "Single image upload karo. Response me `url` (Cloudinary URL) aur `publicId` milega."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload Product Images — batch (field: images)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data[0] && json.data[0].publicId) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"publicId\", json.data[0].publicId);",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test(\"Batch upload successful\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "images",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Image 1 select karo"
                },
                {
                  "key": "images",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Image 2 (same field name \"images\" repeat hota hai, max 5)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/uploads/product-images",
            "description": "Multiple product images ek request me (max 5). Field name MUST \"images\" ho."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload File — pdf/doc/zip (field: file)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "pdf/doc/docx/xls/xlsx/ppt/pptx/zip/txt/csv/json — max 10MB"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/uploads/file"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Uploaded Asset",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"publicId\": \"{{publicId}}\",\n  \"resourceType\": \"image\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/uploads/destroy",
            "description": "Cloudinary asset delete karo publicId se. Sirf \"ecommerce/\" folder ke andar wali files delete ho sakti hain."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload without Token (401 check ❌)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [{ "key": "image", "type": "file", "src": [] }]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/uploads/image"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload Wrong File Type (400 check ❌)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "image",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Koi non-image file select karo (.txt ya .pdf) — 400 aana chahiye"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/uploads/image"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Products (multipart)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Product with Images (multipart)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data._id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"productId\", json.data._id);",
                  "    console.log(\"productId captured ✅\");",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test(\"Product created (201)\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "name", "value": "Wireless Headphones", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "price", "value": "2999", "type": "text", "description": "String me bhi bhej sakte ho — auto number me convert hota hai" },
                { "key": "category", "value": "electronics", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "description", "value": "Best noise cancelling headphones", "type": "text" },
                {
                  "key": "images",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Main product image (pehli image = main image)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "images",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Gallery image 2 (optional, max 5)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products",
            "description": "Product create karo + images ek hi request me upload karo. Files Cloudinary pe jaati hain aur URL DB me save hota hai.\n\nNote: JSON body se bhi product create ho sakta hai (image as URL string) — purana flow bilkul same chalta hai."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Product — Image Only (multipart)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "images",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Nayi image — purani Cloudinary se auto-delete ho jaayegi"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}",
            "description": "Sirf image replace karni ho (bina text fields ke) — ye bhi kaam karta hai! Purani image Cloudinary se automatically delete ho jaati hai (orphan files nahi jama hoti)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Product — JSON (backward compat)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"price\": 1999\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
